{"text": "On Saturday morning, Ani and her family take the bus to Dilijan. The road goes up into the green mountains, and Ani looks out of the window the whole time. In Dilijan the air is fresh and cool. They walk through the forest, listen to the birds and have a picnic by a small lake. Ani finds a red leaf and puts it in her notebook. In the evening she is tired, but she smiles. 'Can we come back in the spring?' she asks.", "words": [[0.54, 0.64], [0.74, 1.14], [1.24, 1.66], [2.12, 2.36], [2.42, 2.5], [2.54, 2.62], [2.7, 3.08], [3.22, 3.42], [3.46, 3.54], [3.58, 3.8], [3.86, 3.92], [3.98, 4.42], [5.8, 5.88], [5.94, 6.24], [6.32, 6.6], [6.64, 6.76], [6.8, 6.94], [6.98, 7.04], [7.08, 7.36], [7.44, 8.08], [8.58, 8.68], [8.76, 8.94], [9.04, 9.26], [9.32, 9.46], [9.48, 9.54], [9.56, 9.62], [9.66, 9.96], [10.06, 10.14], [10.18, 10.4], [10.44, 10.88], [12.18, 12.28], [12.34, 12.78], [12.86, 12.94], [13.06, 13.22], [13.28, 13.38], [13.46, 13.82], [13.9, 14.0], [14.06, 14.42], [15.82, 15.94], [16.0, 16.18], [16.24, 16.4], [16.42, 16.48], [16.58, 17.14], [17.56, 17.82], [17.9, 17.94], [17.98, 18.04], [18.08, 18.5], [18.54, 18.64], [18.68, 18.8], [18.82, 18.85], [18.92, 19.26], [19.38, 19.5], [19.56, 19.59], [19.68, 19.96], [20.04, 20.38], [21.76, 21.98], [22.08, 22.42], [22.44, 22.47], [22.54, 22.7], [22.8, 23.06], [23.24, 23.34], [23.38, 23.62], [23.68, 23.76], [23.82, 23.9], [23.94, 24.0], [24.08, 24.62], [25.98, 26.06], [26.1, 26.18], [26.28, 26.64], [26.7, 26.76], [26.82, 26.92], [26.98, 27.44], [27.52, 27.64], [27.68, 27.74], [27.86, 28.44], [28.58, 29.94], [29.98, 30.04], [30.1, 30.3], [30.34, 30.54], [30.58, 30.64], [30.66, 30.72], [30.78, 31.48], [31.52, 31.6], [31.74, 32.371]], "tag": "kokoro:bf_emma", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}